From 7950754fbd51d429d93074bd00f6a5030bfc9a1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lightvik <lightvik@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 19:06:37 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] tailscale: custom login server (Headscale) support

Add a "Login Server" field to the Tailscale settings page. The value is
stored in /etc/kvm/tailscale_login_server and passed to tailscale login/up
as --login-server, so NanoKVM can join Headscale or any other compatible
control server instead of controlplane.tailscale.com.

- GET/POST /api/extensions/tailscale/login-server
- status response includes loginServer
- uninstall also removes /usr/bin/tailscale.real (wrapper setup)
